                <div class="about__intro lead">
                    <p>Hi, I'm <strong>Praveen Kumar</strong>. Maverick Times is my personal space for writing about things I find interesting, useful, or worth exploring.</p>
                    <p>I spend a lot of my time learning and working on <strong>SEO, websites, content and digital marketing</strong>. I enjoy figuring out why a page ranks, how people search for information, and how a simple website can gradually grow through useful content.</p>
                    <p>Alongside that, I like following <strong>trending startups, business ideas, marketing strategies and technology</strong>. Since I am based around Warangal, I also want to document the places, food and local experiences that are easy to overlook online.</p>
                </div>
